    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/26ad1ad08c52d6e76bc1bf0b034fddc6.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a flip coin game with the devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep all the coins you flipped in your pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing comes for free; you'll need to pay the debt in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, some bad things could happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fill your pocket full before you run out of luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/678b6d117a1ea9ccf19dc5db09d93c6b.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have bad luck? Worry not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the round, the devil is kind enough to provide one item for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The item can be used to improve your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you have more to spare, you can buy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to utilize them to build a strategy to maximize your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/68bbe99b79584b12c42592c1bfbf018b.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you gain from the game to upgrade the items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More upgrades, more profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At some point, you might find yourself not needing any luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just craft your own victory by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The snowball will get bigger and bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c10c02e5f06c924c581ba060705d37eb.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c10c02e5f06c924c581ba060705d37eb.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c10c02e5f06c924c581ba060705d37eb.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/ed1d79f153928baf857a6ae070a2acf6.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft you own items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the devil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/9722e3ea317d9cc9633f7a88d2c48f34.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/9722e3ea317d9cc9633f7a88d2c48f34.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/9722e3ea317d9cc9633f7a88d2c48f34.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/26ad1ad08c52d6e76bc1bf0b034fddc6.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a flip coin game with the devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep all the coins you flipped in your pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing comes for free; you'll need to pay the debt in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, some bad things could happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fill your pocket full before you run out of luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/969ea22f69fd6607b26c7a2e4a06b9f1.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/678b6d117a1ea9ccf19dc5db09d93c6b.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have bad luck? Worry not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the round, the devil is kind enough to provide one item for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The item can be used to improve your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you have more to spare, you can buy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to utilize them to build a strategy to maximize your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/a95265ba9d352a1e7eae7484f20040b4.mp4?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/68bbe99b79584b12c42592c1bfbf018b.avif?t=1753957283\" width=500 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you gain from the game to upgrade the items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More upgrades, more profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At some point, you might find yourself not needing any luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just craft your own victory by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The snowball will get bigger and bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c10c02e5f06c924c581ba060705d37eb.poster.avif?t=1753957283\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c10c02e5f06c924c581ba060705d37eb.webm?t=1753957283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/c1